<div class="mcard"><b>USE A FUEL CELL?</b><p><%~ it.refineryClientStateRefineryFuelQuoteN %> cell → <%~ it.refineryClientStateRefineryFuelQuoteGain %> fuel · <%~ it.refineryClientStateRefineryFuelQuoteBefore %> → <%~ it.refineryClientStateRefineryFuelQuoteBefore2 %> / <%~ it.refineryClientStateRefineryFuelQuoteCapacity %>. This uses one cell. Your ship must have room for the full amount of fuel.</p><button class="btn sm" data-refinery="fuel" data-id="<%= it.refineryClientStateRefineryFuelQuoteId %>">USE CELL</button></div>